{"4781740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Funky Pirates", "steam_appid": 4781740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [5099400], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a pirate isn't just about sailing the high seas, plundering merchant convoys, and immersing yourself in ship-to-ship battles. It's also about hunting for treasures hidden on distant islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every pirate is destined to find the coveted loot, as it's impossible to locate the treasure without a map in hand. Rejoice and celebrate, for luck is on your side—you already have half of the map, which led you straight to the fabled Treasure Island! But where do you find the other half? Alas, you aren't the only lucky ones today. Another pirate ship has dropped anchor on the opposite shore, and her crew holds the missing piece of the map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781740/extras/a6a1c3c951fcd0c2f7607c948372b231.poster.avif?t=1787077553\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781740/extras/a6a1c3c951fcd0c2f7607c948372b231.webm?t=1787077553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781740/extras/a6a1c3c951fcd0c2f7607c948372b231.mp4?t=1787077553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As pirate tradition dictates, loot is only shared with your own crew, which means there can be no peaceful resolution between the two bands! Whoever claims the complete map claims the treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the enemy cartographer, steal the map, and dig up the chest. Haul it aboard your ship and sail away with the loot! But be prepared—the rival pirates won't give up easily. Anything goes: fists, pistols, coconuts, traps, and bombs. After all, the stakes have never been higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781740/extras/90f52979542c588c081e1fd6d4a085ec.poster.avif?t=1787077553\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781740/extras/90f52979542c588c081e1fd6d4a085ec.webm?t=1787077553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781740/extras/90f52979542c588c081e1fd6d4a085ec.mp4?t=1787077553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will emerge victorious? You write your own story. Set off on your adventure and prove to everyone that the treasure is rightfully yours!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a pirate isn't just about sailing the high seas, plundering merchant convoys, and immersing yourself in ship-to-ship battles. It's also about hunting for treasures hidden on distant islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every pirate is destined to find the coveted loot, as it's impossible to locate the treasure without a map in hand. Rejoice and celebrate, for luck is on your side—you already have half of the map, which led you straight to the fabled Treasure Island! But where do you find the other half? Alas, you aren't the only lucky ones today. Another pirate ship has dropped anchor on the opposite shore, and her crew holds the missing piece of the map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781740/extras/a6a1c3c951fcd0c2f7607c948372b231.poster.avif?t=1787077553\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781740/extras/a6a1c3c951fcd0c2f7607c948372b231.webm?t=1787077553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781740/extras/a6a1c3c951fcd0c2f7607c948372b231.mp4?t=1787077553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As pirate tradition dictates, loot is only shared with your own crew, which means there can be no peaceful resolution between the two bands! Whoever claims the complete map claims the treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the enemy cartographer, steal the map, and dig up the chest. Haul it aboard your ship and sail away with the loot! But be prepared—the rival pirates won't give up easily. Anything goes: fists, pistols, coconuts, traps, and bombs. After all, the stakes have never been higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781740/extras/90f52979542c588c081e1fd6d4a085ec.poster.avif?t=1787077553\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781740/extras/90f52979542c588c081e1fd6d4a085ec.webm?t=1787077553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781740/extras/90f52979542c588c081e1fd6d4a085ec.mp4?t=1787077553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will emerge victorious? You write your own story. Set off on your adventure and prove to everyone that the treasure is rightfully yours!</p>", "short_description": "A pirate party-action game with hilarious ragdoll physics! Find the enemy cartographer, snatch their piece of the map, dig up the chest, and haul it aboard your ship. Smash your rivals with fists, pistols, bombs, and coconuts. Steal the map, grab the gold, and sail away!", "supported_languages": "Russian, English", "header_image": "https://